{"suttaId":"tha-ap231","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7935,7950],"vripara":"43"},"segments":{"tha-ap231:0.3":"Sukatāveḷiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap231:1.1":"“Asito nāma nāmena, mālākāro ahaṃ [ahuṃ (?)] tadā;","tha-ap231:1.3":"Āveḷaṃ paggahetvāna, rañño dātuṃ vajāmahaṃ.","tha-ap231:2.1":"“Asampattomhi [asampattamhi (sī.), asampattova (?)] rājānaṃ, addasaṃ sikhināyakaṃ;","tha-ap231:2.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap231:3.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap231:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap231:4.1":"“Pañcavīse ito kappe, rājāhosiṃ mahabbalo;","tha-ap231:4.3":"Vebhāro nāma nāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap231:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap231:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sukatāveḷiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap231:7.1":"Sukatāveḷiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
